s/verify.sh`, CI | Every push and PR |\n    67\t| Tests | `go test ./...` | `scr
ipts/verify.sh`, CI | Every push and PR |\n    68\t| Repository integration test
s | `go test ./internal/controlplane/store/...` | `scripts/verify.sh`, CI | Ever
